sentry_sdk 2.62.0

Source: the PyPI wheel sentry_sdk-2.62.0-py3-none-any.whl
  sha256 27f61d13a86c3c1648dec666dd5a64f79772dd6a84b446f11866601ecab24f6f
The sentry_sdk folder is the wheel's package, unmodified; LICENSE is the wheel's
sentry_sdk-2.62.0.dist-info/licenses/LICENSE. Used by bluepilot/system/sentry.py, which puts
this folder on sys.path. pyproject.toml and uv.lock stay upstream's. The SDK needs urllib3 and
certifi, which the environment already has.

To update:
  pip download sentry-sdk==<version> --no-deps
  check the wheel's sha256 against PyPI
  unzip it, replace bluepilot/vendor/sentry_sdk with its sentry_sdk folder,
  copy sentry_sdk-<version>.dist-info/licenses/LICENSE to bluepilot/vendor/sentry_sdk/LICENSE,
  update this file, run bluepilot/system/tests
